OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists rescued from shortcut
OL,4,Aafter road closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vehicle rescue group has warned
OL,7,Fdrivers against using an unsuitable
OL,8,Froad in the Peak District after
OL,9,Fmultiple call-outs to help stranded
OL,10,Fmotorists.
OL,12,FDerbyshire County Council is
OL,13,Fresurfacing a section of the A54, known
OL,14,Fas the Cat and Fiddle, on the Buxton
OL,15,Fside of the route until October.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1788931610
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists rescued from shortcut
OL,4,Aafter road closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeak 4x4 Response, a charity run by
OL,7,Fvolunteers, said some motorists had
OL,8,Fignored the designated diversion -
OL,9,Fwhich runs through the centre of Leek
OL,10,Fin Staffordshire - and chosen a more
OL,11,Fdirect route from Buxton along
OL,12,FMacclesfield Old Road.
OL,14,FMarcus Murray, of Peak 4x4 Response,
OL,15,Fsaid Macclesfield Old Road contained
OL,16,Fboulders, steps and washouts that made
OL,17,Fit unsuitable for standard road
OL,18,Fvehicles.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
